  "id": "RAW_92b09c6e01",
  "title": "拆解小红书存储底座 03｜从存得下到读得快：小红书自研对象存储实践",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&mid=2247496995&idx=1&sn=4f8f5120b9fff8d77f0c8c9d9c590fee",
  "date": "2026-11-05 17:59:00",
  "author": "小红书技术REDtech",
  "siteName": "小红书技术REDtech",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>REDtech</span> <span>2026-11-05 17:59</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">湖北</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150304_f07f211.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>从多云统一接入到 HDD、SSD 引擎优化，看小红书自研对象存储 ROS 如何兼顾容量、带宽与成本，支撑多媒体、大数据和 AI 训练。</p>\n  <div style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;text-decoration-thickness: auto;text-decoration-style: solid;font-size: 15px;padding: 0px 7px;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2777778\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100013334\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150304_b1a2d4a.jpeg\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 20px;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 3px;border-left: 3px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.32);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"margin: 5px 0px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(160, 160, 160);line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小红书的存储与数据库体系覆盖 MySQL、RedKV、Redis、ROS 等产品，DMS、RedDTS 等公共能力分别提供统一管控和数据传输支持。小红书自研对象存储&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">ROS</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">（Red Object Storage）服务于多媒体、大数据、索引构建和 AI 训练等多个业务，多媒体在线访问关注可靠性与低时延，大数据与索引构建需要持续高吞吐，AI 训练则要求高并发读取与 Checkpoint 集中写入。</span></p>\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">本文介绍 ROS 的整体架构，包括多云统一网关、元数据管理和存储引擎的核心设计，重点说明如何通过 HDD 的内外圈放置、亲和预分配与预读，以及 SSD 的 RDMA 网络、SPDK 用户态 I/O 与 NUMA 亲和，满足不同业务的存储需求。</span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 5px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6212963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013335\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_5a72030.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小红书的多媒体、大数据、索引构建和 AI 训练等业务使用多个云厂商的对象存储服务。随着业务规模增长，不同场景对可靠性、时延和读写带宽提出了更高要求，统一接入、鉴权、流控与监控，以及跨引擎的数据管理需求也日益突出。为此，小红书建设自研对象存储 ROS，在自建与公有云共同承载数据的混合云架构下，统一业务接入与数据管理，并通过自研存储引擎提升单位存储容量的读写带宽，满足不同业务的性能与稳定性需求。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">整体架构</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6972222\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100013336\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_3e05e5d.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 15px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">ROS 采用自建与公有云共同承载数据的混合云架构，业务通过 S3 SDK 接入，各模块分工如下：</span></p>\n     <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">多云统一网关：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">提供统一接入，负责协议适配、鉴权、流控和路由，屏蔽不同存储后端的接口差异。</span></p>\n      </li>\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RedDB：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">提供对象存储元数据服务，可随 Bucket 对象数量增长自动分裂，线上已经支持单 Bucket 千亿对象规模。</span></p>\n      </li>\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RedStore：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">自研池化存储引擎，提供 HDD 和 SSD 两类引擎，与公有云对象存储共同承载数据，满足不同业务的容量、性能和成本需求。</span></p>\n      </li>\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">离线系统：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">负责跨区域、跨集群数据调度、生命周期沉降与引擎置换，支持数据跨区域、跨引擎流转。</span></p>\n      </li>\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">全 Kubernetes 部署：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">ROS 的全部服务都通过 Kubernetes 统一编排，支撑部署、扩缩容与运维管理。</span></p>\n      </li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 15px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">多云统一网关</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">多云统一网关面向自建与公有云共同承载数据的混合云场景，提供兼容 S3 的统一入口。业务通过同一套 S3 SDK 接入，网关负责协议适配、鉴权、分布式流控和路由，并汇集多云访问日志与监控数据，减少业务对不同后端的重复适配。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Bucket 可按需选择存储引擎：高性能、大带宽场景选择 SSD，成本敏感场景选择 HDD。多云统一网关还支持引擎置换。例如，RedStore 空间不足时，可将 Bucket 的数据迁移到 云上对象存储。迁移期间，未迁移的对象仍读 RedStore，已迁移的对象读 云上对象存储；业务保持原有接口、桶名和对象名称，无需适配后端变化。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">通过多云统一网关与离线系统协作，ROS 可利用引擎置换缓解容量运营压力，支持将存储利用率提升到 90%。离线系统还负责跨区域、跨集群数据调度与跨云生命周期沉降，使数据随资源和访问需求流转。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6564815\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013337\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_12959f7.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">存储引擎</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(236, 43, 43);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">3.1 HDD 存储引擎</span></span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大数据扫描和批量读取需要持续、稳定的高带宽，而 HDD 上分散的小块访问容易受到寻道开销限制。ROS 通过多节点、多磁盘并行，结合内外圈放置、亲和预分配与预读，减少随机寻道、提升连续访问效率。在读写比为 2∶5、平均对象大小为 64 MiB 的线上真实负载下，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">每 PiB 可提供 20 Gbps 读带宽和 10 Gbps 写带宽。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">其中，热存副本放置在外圈，冷存副本放置在内圈，利用外圈较高的顺序读写带宽优先服务热数据访问。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.662963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100013333\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_a6b8327.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">预分配解决“写得近”：写端传递相关 Blob（对象逻辑分块）的亲和信息，转换为分片提示，DataNode 提前预留连续空间，减少后续分散写入。预读解决“读得顺”：读取时按需</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">预读相邻分片</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，供后续请求复用，把相关小块访问转化为更连续的磁盘 I/O。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">预读的目标是提高业务有效吞吐，而不是扩大磁盘读取量。因此，需要结合命中率、空间压力和带宽消耗控制预读范围，避免无效读取挤占正常请求。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(236, 43, 43);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">3.2 SSD 存储引擎</span></span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI 训练与索引加载需要持续的大带宽，仅更换 SSD 还不够，网络处理、数据拷贝和软件 I/O 路径都可能成为瓶颈。ROS-Express 将优化延伸到网络与本地存储，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">每 PiB 提供 1Tbps 读带宽和 250Gbps 写带宽。</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666667\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100013340\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_70de5b6.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">业务通过 S3 SDK 经多云统一网关进入 Access 数据访问层，再通过 RDMA 网络访问 DataNode 数据节点。</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RDMA 减少网络处理的 CPU 开销与数据拷贝；网络 Poller 与各盘 SPDK Poller 异步协作，减少中断与调度开销，并通过用户态异步 I/O 发挥 NVMe 的并发能力。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">结合节点横向扩展，将多节点、多磁盘的带宽汇聚为服务能力。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">高性能 SSD 引擎以全内存索引减少寻址所需的磁盘访问，并通过 NUMA 亲和，让 CPU、内存、网卡与磁盘就近协作。面向 QLC，在设备支持时利用&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">FDP</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">(Flexible Data Placement) 按数据生命周期优化放置，降低垃圾回收带来的写放大，具体设计将在后续专篇展开。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">04</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">数据组织</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RedStore 按对象大小选择保存方式，并通过分层寻址定位数据。以下先介绍写入时的对象分块与数据保护，再说明读取时如何找到对应的节点和磁盘数据。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(236, 43, 43);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">4.1 对象分块与数据保护</span></span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 5px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666667\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013342\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_25c747a.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">按对象大小分级。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">小于 1KiB 的对象支持将数据内联保存在 RedDB；大于等于 1KiB 且小于 512KiB 的对象采用 4 副本；512KiB 及以上的对象按 Blob 组织并采用纠删码（EC）保护。单次 PUT 上限为 5GiB，更大对象使用分段上传。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">分块与尾块合并。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">Blob 是对象的逻辑分块，默认按 5MiB 划分。存在前块且非零尾块不超过 1MiB 时，写入前将尾块并入前块，末块最大为 6MiB。例如，16MiB 对象拆成 5、5、6MiB 三个 Blob，避免单独保存一个 1MiB 小尾块。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">EC 编码保护。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">以 8＋3 编码为例，每个 Blob 生成 8 份数据分片和 3 份校验分片，跨 DataNode 放置。部分分片不可用时，只要有效分片满足恢复条件，即可通过解码恢复数据，并由后台重建补齐冗余。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(236, 43, 43);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">4.2 分层组织与寻址</span></span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 7px 0px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666667\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013339\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_f687955.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">读取时，RedDB 提供对象的 Blob（逻辑分块）布局与标识。系统根据 Cluster ID 选择集群，再通过 Space 和 Volume 查找分片位置：同一 Space 使用相同编码策略，Volume 管理一组分片的放置关系，Vlet 是节点内的分片管理单元。请求到达 DataNode 后，按 VBID（卷内 Blob 标识）查询本地索引，定位磁盘数据。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">分层管理将对象布局与物理位置解耦，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">支持按集群扩展存储资源。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">数据容错依靠副本、EC 与故障域放置。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">05</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">未来展望</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小红书自研存储仍在持续迭代。未来将打通对象与文件访问，让同一份数据既可通过 S3 访问，也可通过 RedFuse 提供的 POSIX 接口访问，覆盖 AI 数据采集、清洗、训练与部署流程，减少不同访问方式之间的数据复制。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">面向索引构建等场景，计划为 Bucket 引入层级命名空间：HNS（层级命名空间）管理目录层级、父子关系与路径查找，FNS（扁平命名空间）管理对象元数据与位置索引，共同支撑目录管理与大规模目录重命名需求。同时，将现有的跨引擎数据流转能力扩展到这些场景，通过 SSD、HDD 与云上引擎之间的沉降和置换，兼顾时延、带宽与成本。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100013341\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150305_ea58642.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">作者：</span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">德古｜中台技术部。主要负责对象存储与多云统一网关建设。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">部门介绍：</span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">存储&amp;数据库部，为小红书全业务场景打造行业领先的高可用、高可靠、高性能、低成本的存储和数据库类产品技术服务。团队致力于用精英化的组织和行业领先的技术理念，先于业务布局和行动，为公司业务的快速发展提供充足“弹药”，同时也让小红书存储和数据库成为行业该领域的标杆。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">06</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">招聘</span></b></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span data-xhs-node-propsau=\"&quot;500027929&quot;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid; font-size: 15px; padding: 0px 7px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-autospace: normal;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 2; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-slate-node&quot;:&quot;element&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-xhs-node-propsau&quot;:&quot;\\&quot;500027929\\&quot;&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">分布式存储研发工程师</span></span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"weapp_text_link js_weapp_entry\" style=\"\" data-unique-id=\"mw31q01s-5vfif1\" data-miniprogram-type=\"text\" data-miniprogram-appid=\"wx6e18c5c45387efa2\" data-miniprogram-path=\"pages/detail/detail?id=14356&amp;sourceChannel=website\" data-miniprogram-nickname=\"小红书招聘\" data-miniprogram-servicetype=\"0\" data-miniprogram-applink=\"#小程序://小红书招聘/wEbZv17cyIq1j5z\">小红书招聘</a></span></p>\n    <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">块/文件/对象/存储底座等方向</span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100013338\" data-ratio=\"0.2777778\" data-s=\"300,640\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105150304_e4642e5.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "小红书自研对象存储 ROS 通过混合云架构、HDD 内外圈放置与 SSD RDMA 优化，实现高带宽读写，支撑多媒体、大数据和 AI 训练等业务场景。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "小红书自研对象存储 ROS 通过混合云架构、HDD 内外圈放置与 SSD RDMA 优化，实现高带宽读写，支撑多媒体、大数据和 AI 训练等业务场景。",
  "summary": "本文介绍了小红书自研对象存储 ROS 的整体架构与核心设计。ROS 采用自建与公有云共同承载数据的混合云架构，业务通过 S3 SDK 统一接入；多云统一网关负责协议适配、鉴权、流控和路由；RedDB 提供千亿对象规模的元数据服务；RedStore 提供 HDD 与 SSD 两类存储引擎。HDD 引擎通过内外圈放置、亲和预分配与预读，实现每 PiB 提供 20 Gbps 读带宽和 10 Gbps 写带宽；SSD 引擎利用 RDMA 网络、SPDK 用户态 I/O 与 NUMA 亲和，实现每 PiB 提供 1Tbps 读带宽和 250Gbps 写带宽。文章还说明了对象分块与数据保护机制（内联、副本、EC 编码），以及分层寻址与未来计划引入层级命名空间等。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "混合云架构与统一接入",
      "explanation": "ROS 采用自建与公有云共同承载数据的混合云架构，业务通过 S3 SDK 统一接入；多云统一网关负责协议适配、鉴权、流控和路由，屏蔽不同存储后端的接口差异。"
    },
    {
      "point": "HDD 存储引擎的高带宽优化",
      "explanation": "通过内外圈放置、亲和预分配与预读技术，减少随机寻道、提升连续访问效率，在读写比为 2∶5、平均对象大小为 64 MiB 的负载下，每 PiB 可提供 20 Gbps 读带宽和 10 Gbps 写带宽。"
    },
    {
      "point": "SSD 存储引擎的网络与 I/O 优化",
      "explanation": "利用 RDMA 网络减少 CPU 开销与数据拷贝，结合 SPDK 用户态 I/O 与 NUMA 亲和，实现每 PiB 提供 1Tbps 读带宽和 250Gbps 写带宽，满足 AI 训练与索引加载的持续大带宽需求。"
    },
    {
      "point": "对象分块与数据保护机制",
